      "content": "I understand, but honestly I feel much better and I'm really just trying to manage this without a whole ordeal. My neighbor actually told me that if I just take some extra magnesium and maybe an aspirin, it would help stabilize my blood pressure and keep me from feeling lightheaded like that again. Do you think that's a safe way to handle it for the next few days so I can avoid the clinic?",
